msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can help translate Pipeline using <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan hjälpa till att översätta Pipeline via <a href=\"https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:100
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The source code of Pipeline is hosted on <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/"
"schmiddi-on-mobile/pipeline\">GitLab</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipelines källkod finns på <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/schmiddi-on-mobile/"
"pipeline\">GitLab</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:106
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We have a <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix "
"room</a> where you can come and talk with us."
msgstr ""
"Vi har ett <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix-"
"rum</a> där du kan prata med oss."

#: src/splashes.rs:112
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has a <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">website</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline har en <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">"
"webbplats</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:118
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can get Pipeline on <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan hämta Pipeline på <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:124
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> as the "
"video player."
msgstr ""
"Vi använder <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> som "
"videospelare."

#: src/splashes.rs:130
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> "
"and <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> to get data from YouTube."
msgstr ""
"Vi använder <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</"
"a> och <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> för att hämta data från "
"YouTube."

#: src/splashes.rs:136
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The creator of Pipeline has also built other applications, like <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipelines skapare har även utvecklat andra appar, till exempel <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> och <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:142
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"When using Piped to fetch data, Pipeline will be able to fetch your "
"subscriptions faster with more public Piped instances. So consider <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> and "
"making it available for everyone."
msgstr ""
"När Piped används för att hämta data kan Pipeline hämta dina prenumerationer "
"snabbare om det finns fler offentliga Piped-instanser. Överväg därför att <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">driva en Piped-instans</"
"a> och göra den tillgänglig för alla."

#: src/splashes.rs:148
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"No animals were harmed while making this application. But two cats were "
"petted."
msgstr ""
"Inga djur kom till skada när appen utvecklades. Däremot blev två katter "
"klappade."

#: src/splashes.rs:155
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Add videos to your watch-later list by bringing up their context menu, or "
"directly when watching videos."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till videor i listan Titta senare via deras snabbmeny eller direkt "
"medan du tittar på dem."

#: src/splashes.rs:161
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Seeing something you don't like? You can hide videos from your feed based on "
"the title and uploader of the video."
msgstr ""
"Ser du något du inte gillar? Du kan dölja videor i flödet utifrån videons "
"titel och uppladdare."

#: src/splashes.rs:167
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can hide videos you already watched. Enable this by managing your "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"Du kan dölja videor som du redan har tittat på. Aktivera funktionen genom "
"att hantera dina filter."

#: src/splashes.rs:173
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can quickly toggle on and off filters in the feed from the filter dialog."
msgstr "Du kan snabbt slå på och av filter i flödet via filterdialogrutan."

#: src/splashes.rs:179
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to keep your subscriptions from YouTube or NewPipe? You can import "
"those into Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Vill du behålla dina prenumerationer från YouTube eller NewPipe? Du kan "
"importera dem till Pipeline."

#: src/splashes.rs:185
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to bring your own video player instead of the one built-in? You can "
"manage an external video player in the settings and tell Pipeline to use it "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Vill du använda en annan videospelare än den inbyggda? Du kan konfigurera en "
"extern videospelare i inställningarna och låta Pipeline använda den som "
"standard."

#: src/splashes.rs:191
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You want to keep a video you watched? You can directly download it from the "
"video page."
msgstr ""
"Vill du behålla en video som du har tittat på? Du kan ladda ned den direkt "
"från videosidan."

#: src/splashes.rs:197
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to share a video? You can copy its URL to the clipboard directly from "
"the video page."
msgstr ""
"Vill du dela en video? Du kan kopiera dess webbadress till urklipp direkt "
"från videosidan."

#: src/splashes.rs:203
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Are you hosting your own Piped instance? You can tell Pipeline to use it in "
"the settings."
msgstr ""
"Driver du en egen Piped-instans? Du kan ange i inställningarna att Pipeline "
"ska använda den."

#: src/splashes.rs:210
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Not interested in those splash texts? You can disable them in the settings."
msgstr "Vill du inte se starttexterna? Du kan inaktivera dem i inställningarna."

#: src/splashes.rs:216
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Don't like YouTube anymore? Pipeline also works with <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tycker du inte längre om YouTube? Pipeline fungerar även med <a "
"href=\"https://joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:222
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Searching for something? Pipeline can help you with that and search for "
"channels and videos on YouTube and Peertube."
msgstr ""
"Letar du efter något? Pipeline kan söka efter kanaler och videor på YouTube "
"och PeerTube."

#: src/splashes.rs:228
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has four different ways to fetch videos from YouTube. Just to be "
"sure you don't miss any of your precious cat videos."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline kan hämta videor från YouTube på fyra olika sätt, så att du inte "
"missar någon av dina värdefulla kattvideor."

#: src/splashes.rs:243
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Have ideas for further splash text? Tell us on <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/"
"%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."
msgstr ""
"Har du förslag på fler starttexter? Berätta för oss på <a href=\"https://"
"matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:249
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pretty sure {year} will be the year of the Linux desktop."
msgstr "Ganska säker på att {year} blir Linux-skrivbordets år."

#. Translators: A reference to the "I use Arch btw" meme.
#: src/splashes.rs:255
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "I can be used on Arch btw."
msgstr "Jag kan förresten köras på Arch."

#: src/splashes.rs:260
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Do you want to advertise here? You can't."
msgstr "Vill du annonsera här? Det går inte."

#: src/splashes.rs:277
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "🎉 Pipeline turned {} years old today. Happy Birthday! 🎉"
msgstr "🎉 Pipeline fyller {} år i dag. Grattis på födelsedagen! 🎉"

